    "inputHash": "sha256:8e2fb39b4d47a14804e84347fd882fa8081cb4f89a4adc3aeef639e0c327cec5",
    "notes": "Les Ferreres Aqueduct has 25 upper arches, 11 lower arches, tapered piers, and an open upper channel. The model follows the signed course and includes both entrances, the lower path, and the mapped ravine relief. The localized ravine depth, hillside grade, scrub and exposed drainage bed are photo-led approximations between the standard terrain samples. The path network carries modeled geometric grades. Seasonal flow is unverified. The 242.225 m mapped channel includes its approaches. The tourism authority describes a 217 m surviving arcade and a maximum height of 26 m."
  },
